[ system ]
Choose which person, if any, has the strongest reason to write to {{ player }} now. Use their profiles, memories and conversations.
[ end system ]

[ user ]
{% for c in candidates %}
## {{ c.number }}. {{ c.name }}, {{ c.place }}
{{ render_character_profile("short_inline", c.UUID) }}
{% if c.never_met %}Has never met {{ player }}.{% endif %}
{% if c.days_since_seen == 0 %}Dealt with {{ player }} earlier today.{% else if c.days_since_seen == 1 %}Last dealt with {{ player }} a day ago.{% else if c.days_since_seen > 1 %}Last dealt with {{ player }} {{ c.days_since_seen }} days ago.{% endif %}
{% if c.dialogue and length(c.dialogue) > 0 %}
The last time they spoke:
{% for line in c.dialogue -%}
{{ line.speaker }}: {{ line.text }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if c.memories and length(c.memories) > 0 %}
What {{ c.name }} remembers of {{ player }}:
{% for memory in c.memories -%}
- {{ memory }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% endfor %}
{{ player }} is in {{ player_place }}. Prefer speaking in person when they can easily meet. Candidates only know {{ player }}'s whereabouts if they learned them through conversation or memories.

A personal connection or practical business can support a letter. Match familiarity to their established relationship. Use a subject from the context when available, or ordinary news that fits their life and relationship. A first contact needs a reason to approach {{ player }} specifically.

Return only a JSON object with the chosen person's number (0 if nobody has a reason) and a brief reason: {"pick": <number>, "why": "<reason>"}
[ end user ]
